            "text": "NDI Audio In \u2014 Audio-Reactive Visuals\n\nReceives NDI audio, smooths it with Lag\nfor stable envelope following, then\ncomposites the smoothed audio waveform\nover a Noise texture for audio-reactive art.\n\nThe CHOP chain feeds into CHOPtoTOP, which\nis composited with the NoiseTOP via Composite.",
